<title>UK: Reuters says adjourns cash return proposals.</title>
<headline>Reuters says adjourns cash return proposals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>News and information organisation Reuters Holdings Plc said on Tuesday it would ask shareholders to delay consideration of plans to return 613 million stg to shareholders via a share buyback and special dividend.</p>
<p>The announcement follows a decision earlier on Tuesday by the British government to immediately abolish tax credits on share buybacks and related special dividends, making these schemes less attractive to tax-exempt investors.</p>
</text>
